  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "すごい　ちからを　はっきして\nあいてを　こうげきする。じぶんの\nこうげきと　ぼうぎょが　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "엄청난 힘을 발휘하여\n상대를 공격한다. 자신의\n공격과 방어가 떨어진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "發揮驚人的力量攻擊對手。\n自己的攻擊和防禦會降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une attaque puissante, mais qui baisse l’Attaque\net la Défense du lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Starke Attacke, die jedoch auch den Angriff und die\nVerteidigung des Anwenders senkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque de gran potencia, pero que reduce el Ataque y\nla Defensa del agresor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio con grande forza,\nma il suo Attacco e la sua Difesa diminuiscono.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with great power.\nHowever, this also lowers the user’s Attack and\nDefense stats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "すごい　力を　発揮して\n相手を　攻撃する。自分の\n攻撃と　防御が　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "发挥惊人的力量攻击对手。\n自己的攻击和防御会降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque de gran potencia, pero que reduce el Ataque y\nla Defensa del agresor.",
      "version_group": {
